interaction pattern of SwiftPieces CommitButton by Saivion Hayes
(https://github.com/Saivion/SwiftPieces), used under its MIT + Commons Clause
License Condition v1.0; the upstream copyright and permission notice are
reproduced in that file. No upstream source lines were copied.

The native CLI and MCP adapter use the official MCP Swift SDK and resolved
Swift dependencies: swift-system, swift-log and EventSource. The package also
resolves swift-nio, swift-atomics and swift-collections; swift-nio includes
CNIOLLHTTP. These dependencies retain their respective upstream licences and
notices. Full LICENSE and NOTICE files from the pinned SwiftPM checkouts,
including the SDK's licensing-transition notice and CNIOLLHTTP's notice, are
bundled under Contents/Resources/Licenses/<dependency>. Package.resolved records
the exact source revisions. These notices do not change the licences of the
upstream components.
